{
 "name": "Website to contacts: enrich a lead list in Google Sheets",
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "about-this-workflow",
   "name": "About this workflow",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    -640,
    100
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## Website to contacts: enrich a lead list\n\nFor each company website in a Google Sheet, this workflow finds the contact details the company publishes itself (business email, phone, LinkedIn page, legal name, VAT ID) and writes them into the same row.\n\n### Setup (5 minutes)\n1. Your sheet needs a column `website` (a domain or URL). Add the columns `company`, `email`, `phone`, `linkedin`, `vat_id`, `contacts_status`.\n2. Pick your sheet in **Read leads** and **Write the contacts**.\n3. In **Find contacts**, create a CompassLab credential: free plan on api.market or RapidAPI.\n\nOnly business contacts are returned (no personal emails), robots.txt is respected, and `contacts_status` tells you when a site publishes nothing or blocks bots.",
    "width": 560,
    "height": 520,
    "color": "6"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "every-day",
   "name": "Every day",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
   "typeVersion": 1.2,
   "position": [
    0,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "rule": {
     "interval": [
      {
       "triggerAtHour": 8
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "read-leads",
   "name": "Read leads",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4.7,
   "position": [
    220,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "documentId": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": ""
    },
    "sheetName": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "gid=0",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "only-new-leads",
   "name": "Only new leads",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
   "typeVersion": 2.2,
   "position": [
    440,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "conditions": {
     "options": {
      "caseSensitive": true,
      "leftValue": "",
      "typeValidation": "loose",
      "version": 2
     },
     "conditions": [
      {
       "id": "1",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.website }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "string",
        "operation": "notEmpty",
        "singleValue": true
       }
      },
      {
       "id": "2",
       "leftValue": "={{ $json.contacts_status }}",
       "rightValue": "",
       "operator": {
        "type": "string",
        "operation": "empty",
        "singleValue": true
       }
      }
     ],
     "combinator": "and"
    },
    "options": {}
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "find-contacts",
   "name": "Find contacts",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-compasslab.compassLab",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    660,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "resource": "contact",
    "operation": "findContacts",
    "domain": "={{ $json.website }}"
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "write-the-contacts",
   "name": "Write the contacts",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
   "typeVersion": 4.7,
   "position": [
    880,
    300
   ],
   "parameters": {
    "operation": "update",
    "documentId": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": ""
    },
    "sheetName": {
     "__rl": true,
     "value": "gid=0",
     "mode": "list",
     "cachedResultName": "Sheet1"
    },
    "columns": {
     "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
     "value": {
      "website": "={{ $('Only new leads').item.json.website }}",
      "company": "={{ $json.company?.legal_name || $json.company?.name || '' }}",
      "email": "={{ $json.emails?.[0]?.value ?? '' }}",
      "phone": "={{ $json.phones?.[0]?.e164 ?? '' }}",
      "linkedin": "={{ $json.social_profiles?.find(p => p.network === 'linkedin')?.url ?? '' }}",
      "vat_id": "={{ $json.company?.vat_id ?? '' }}",
      "contacts_status": "={{ $json.status }}"
     },
     "matchingColumns": [
      "website"
     ],
